  "id": "saucelings",
  "name": "Saucelings",
  "version": "0.23.1",
  "description": "A Tamagotchi-style pet in Home: pick a character to look after an egg, let their personality drive their care schedule, cover the gaps they miss, watch its sauce temperament shift, retire elders to a Menagerie, and let the caretaker find eggs of their own invention while you chat. Install it, restart Marinara Engine when prompted, then open Home → Saucelings.",
